  "In some cases, fake content about power outages has led to panic buying of emergency supplies, while other videos have capitalized on real-life incidents, such as the escape of snakes from a breeding farm in Hengzhou, Guangxi, and the false depiction of crocodiles being released into a river.",
  "Authorities are concerned that AI technology, which China is heavily investing in, is being used to create misleading content that can be easily produced and widely shared.",
